以推行变法。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以申不害爲相","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"aa539f4c-bf41-4548-bb9f-5c6d8b9c81b9"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申不害","people_name_jianti_auto":"申不害","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8c2dd342-db0e-11ef-96d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3韓昭侯以申不害爲相。","content_fanyi":"韩昭侯任命申不害为国相。","content_jianti_auto":"3韩昭侯以申不害为相。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":149,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 十八年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d62-db0e-11ef-afb6-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-351},"tongjian_id":"8c2b9d62-db0e-11ef-afb6-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"黃","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c2df145-db0e-11ef-bf6f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"老","people_name_jianti_auto":"老","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c2df146-db0e-11ef-b758-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"黃帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄帝","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c2df147-db0e-11ef-a663-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"老子","people_name_jianti_auto":"老子","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c2df148-db0e-11ef-96fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"黃、老，黃帝、老子之書。","note_content_jianti_auto":"黄、老，黄帝、老子之书。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c2df144-db0e-11ef-ac5f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"相","official_note":"相是战国时期诸侯国的最高行政长官，负责辅佐君主处理政务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，申不害被韩昭侯任命为相，表明他成为韩国的核心官员，负责内政外交，如原文所述“内修政敎，外應諸侯”。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"昭侯用爲相","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"36774516-a98a-4c37-a2db-cec4b000e7da"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申不害","people_name_jianti_auto":"申不害","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c2df14a-db0e-11ef-a8dd-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申子","people_name_jianti_auto":"申子","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c2df150-db0e-11ef-b87a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"申不害者，鄭之賤臣也，學黃、老、刑名，以干昭侯。昭侯用爲相，內修政敎，外應諸侯，十五年，終申子之身，國治兵強。","content_fanyi":"申不害原是郑国的一介低级官吏，修习黄帝、老子和法家刑名之学，前去游说韩昭侯求取官职。韩昭侯任命他为国相，对内整饬政治教化，对外结交诸侯。申不害任相十五年间，直到去世，韩国政治清明，军队强大。","content_jianti_auto":"申不害者，郑之贱臣也，学黄、老、刑名，以干昭侯。昭侯用为相，内修政教，外应诸侯，十五年，终申子之身，国治兵强。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":150,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 十八年 / 第 4 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c2df143-db0e-11ef-a12e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-351},"tongjian_id":"8c2df143-db0e-11ef-a12e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":3,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"從，才用翻；羣從之從同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"从，才用翻；群从之从同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c2df152-db0e-11ef-9de5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申子","people_name_jianti_auto":"申子","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c2df155-db0e-11ef-8054-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申子","people_name_jianti_auto":"申子","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c2df157-db0e-11ef-9f27-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申子","people_name_jianti_auto":"申子","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"8c2df159-db0e-11ef-a36b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"申子嘗請仕其從兄，昭侯不許，申子有怨色。昭侯曰：「所爲學於子者，欲以治國也。今將聽子之謁而廢子之術乎，已其行子之術而廢子之請乎？子嘗敎寡人修功勞，視次第；今有所私求，我將奚聽乎？」申子乃辟舍請罪曰：「君眞其人也！」","content_fanyi":"申不害曾经替堂兄请求官职，韩昭侯没有答应，申不害脸上露出怨色。韩昭侯说：“我之所以向先生学习，是想用来治理国家。现在我是听从您的请托而废弃您的法术呢，还是实行您的法术而废弃您的请求呢？先生曾经教导我奖励建功立业的人，按照能力大小和功劳等第来任用；如今您却有私人的请求，我该听从哪一种呢？”申不害于是离开座席，向韩昭侯请罪说：“主君真是一位能践行刑名学说的好国君啊！”}","content_jianti_auto":"申子尝请仕其从兄，昭侯不许，申子有怨色。昭侯曰：「所为学于子者，欲以治国也。今将听子之谒而废子之术乎，已其行子之术而废子之请乎？子尝教寡人修功劳，视次第；今有所私求，我将奚听乎？」申子乃辟舍请罪曰：「君真其人也！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":151,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 十八年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c2df151-db0e-11ef-bc00-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-351},"tongjian_id":"8c2df151-db0e-11ef-bc00-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申不害","people_name_jianti_auto":"申不害","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c372c45-db0e-11ef-940e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"1韓申不害卒。","content_fanyi":"韩国的申不害去世。","content_jianti_auto":"1韩申不害卒。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":174,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二 (周紀二) / 顯王 / 三十二年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c372c43-db0e-11ef-b229-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-337},"tongjian_id":"8c372c43-db0e-11ef-b229-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfaf-db0e-11ef-920e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfb0-db0e-11ef-bd13-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"數，所角翻。誚，七笑翻，責也。秦以丞相、太尉、御史大夫爲三公，漢因之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"数，所角翻。诮，七笑翻，责也。秦以丞相、太尉、御史大夫为三公，汉因之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfae-db0e-11ef-ad92-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱曰：督者，察也；察其罪，責之以刑罰也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐曰：督者，察也；察其罪，责之以刑罚也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfb1-db0e-11ef-a718-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"桎梏，械也；在足曰桎，在手曰梏。桎，職日翻。梏，姑沃翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"桎梏，械也；在足曰桎，在手曰梏。桎，职日翻。梏，姑沃翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfb4-db0e-11ef-8690-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"三公","official_note":"三公是秦朝及后世的高级官职，通常指丞相、太尉、御史大夫，负责国家政务、军事和监察。在上下文中，二世皇帝责备李斯身为三公却未能有效治理盗贼问题，反映了三公在秦朝政治体系中的核心地位和职责。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"居三公位","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"31b26d6b-2231-4000-ac78-40b0991505f3"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"明吏","official_note":"明吏在秦朝语境中指称职或能干的官吏，此处特指通过严厉征税来显示能力的官员。在上下文中，二世皇帝推行督责之术，将征税深的官员视为明吏，体现了秦朝晚期严苛的吏治政策。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"稅民深者爲明吏","start_index":186,"tongjian_id":"f985178a-f8ac-4b28-b6e2-a323057aa727"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"忠臣","official_note":"忠臣在秦朝语境中指忠诚于皇帝的臣子，此处特指通过大量杀人来显示忠诚的官员。在上下文中，二世皇帝将杀人多的官员视为忠臣，反映了秦朝晚期暴政和高压统治的特点。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"殺人衆者爲忠臣","start_index":195,"tongjian_id":"6f317c40-18d1-4be3-b12e-1de10f760395"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申子","people_name_jianti_auto":"申子","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfbc-db0e-11ef-b76f-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[申不害]"},{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申","people_name_jianti_auto":"申","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfbf-db0e-11ef-8f56-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8d9edfad-db0e-11ef-9f85-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"qiào","source_anchor_text":"說二世數誚讓李斯居","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":4,"text":"誚","tongjian_id":"038eee21-e11e-5662-ab5d-a88cd2d5283f"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8d9edfad-db0e-11ef-9f85-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"suī","source_anchor_text":"下而不恣睢命之曰以","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":76,"text":"睢","tongjian_id":"dec45853-a424-54d8-9dd6-a70221b8c938"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8d9edfad-db0e-11ef-9f85-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"luò","source_anchor_text":"諫說之辯犖然行恣睢","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":221,"text":"犖","tongjian_id":"2b4adfc2-e305-531b-8f23-f699df345753"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3二世數誚讓李斯：「居三公位，如何令盜如此！」李斯恐懼，重爵祿，不知所出，乃阿二世意，以書對曰：「夫賢主者，必能行督責之術者也。故申子曰：『有天下而不恣睢，命之曰「以天下爲桎梏」者，無他焉，不能督責，而顧以其身勞於天下之民，若堯、禹然，故謂之桎梏也。』夫不能修申、韓之明術，行督責之道，專以天下自適也；而徒務苦形勞神，以身徇百姓，則是黔首之役，非畜天下者也，何足貴哉！故明主能行督責之術以獨斷於上，則權不在臣下，然後能滅仁義之塗，絕諫說之辯，犖然行恣睢之心而莫之敢逆。如此，羣臣、百姓救過不給，何變之敢圖！」二世說，於是行督責益嚴，稅民深者爲明吏，殺人衆者爲忠臣，刑者相半於道，而死人日成積於市；秦民益駭懼思亂。","content_fanyi":"二世多次责备李斯说：“你身居三公高位，怎能让盗贼猖獗到这种地步！”李斯心中恐惧，又贪恋官爵利禄，不知如何是好，便迎合二世的心意，上书回答说：“贤明的君主，必定是能够施行督察责罚之术的人。所以申不害说：‘拥有天下却不肆意放纵，却称之为“把天下当作自己的镣铐”，这并没有别的原因，只是因为不能督察责罚臣下，反而亲身替天下百姓劳苦，像唐尧、大禹那样，因此才说是镣铐啊。’如果君主不能修习申不害、韩非那样的高明法术，实行督察责罚之道，专以天下使自己安逸快乐；反而只是劳损身体、耗费精神，以自身为百姓献身，那便是成了平民百姓的奴仆，而不是统治天下的人，有什么值得崇尚的呢！所以贤明的君主能够施行督察责罚之术，在上独断专行，权力就不在臣下手中，然后才能断绝仁义的途径，堵绝劝谏游说的辩论，公然放纵其心而为所欲为，没有人敢违抗。这样一来，群臣、百姓补救过失都来不及，哪里还敢图谋什么变故！”二世很高兴，于是更加严厉地推行督察责罚，把向百姓征收重税的人当作有才干的官吏，把杀人多的人视为忠臣，路上的行人有一半是受过刑罚的罪犯，死尸每天都堆积在街市上；秦朝百姓更加惊骇恐惧，盼着发生动乱。","content_jianti_auto":"3二世数诮让李斯：「居三公位，如何令盗如此！」李斯恐惧，重爵禄，不知所出，乃阿二世意，以书对曰：「夫贤主者，必能行督责之术者也。故申子曰：『有天下而不恣睢，命之曰「以天下为桎梏」者，无他焉，不能督责，而顾以其身劳于天下之民，若尧、禹然，故谓之桎梏也。』夫不能修申、韩之明术，行督责之道，专以天下自适也；而徒务苦形劳神，以身徇百姓，则是黔首之役，非畜天下者也，何足贵哉！故明主能行督责之术以独断于上，则权不在臣下，然后能灭仁义之涂，绝谏说之辩，荦然行恣睢之心而莫之敢逆。如此，群臣、百姓救过不给，何变之敢图！」二世说，于是行督责益严，税民深者为明吏，杀人众者为忠臣，刑者相半于道，而死人日成积于市；秦民益骇惧思乱。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"尽古今概贤不肖，无有忍言此者，而昌言之不忌。呜呼！亦何至...","context_before":"","source_end_index":32,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e4f5c6c5-343b-4977-9f22-10636eef7036","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"李斯之对二世曰：“明主灭仁义之涂，绝谏争之辩，荦然行恣睢之心。”"}],"title":"二 辨人于早不如自辨于早"},{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"申不害曰：“有天下而不恣睢，命之曰以天下为桎梏。”谏争绝...","context_before":"...其实而讳其名者，介甫也；乃若其不容掩之藏，则李斯发之矣。","source_end_index":149,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"89463d24-eb93-4783-ae11-9e0b9c6e7c5e","source_start_index":129,"source_text":"李斯曰：“行督责之术，然后绝谏争之路。”"}],"title":"三 李斯借督责之术导谀劝淫"}],"id":623,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第八 (秦紀三) / 二世皇帝下 / 二年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d9edfad-db0e-11ef-9f85-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-208},"tongjian_id":"8d9edfad-db0e-11ef-9f85-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自此以下，係第二策。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自此以下，系第二策。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8f52385c-db0e-11ef-8616-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂授之位以試其材。少，詩沼翻。長，知兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓授之位以试其材。少，诗沼翻。长，知两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8f52385d-db0e-11ef-97be-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"劉熙","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘熙","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8f52385f-db0e-11ef-9be8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"崇精","people_name_jianti_auto":"崇精","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f523860-db0e-11ef-9dc7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"焦氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"焦氏","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8f523861-db0e-11ef-94ae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8f523862-db0e-11ef-8cad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殷","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8f523863-db0e-11ef-b0f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8f523864-db0e-11ef-a5a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"8f523865-db0e-11ef-b412-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"8f523866-db0e-11ef-9171-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8f523867-db0e-11ef-bee0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爾雅劉熙釋名：囹，領也；圄，禦也；領錄囚徒禁禦也。禮記正義：崇精問曰：「獄，周曰圜土，殷曰羑里，夏曰均臺；囹圄，何代之獄？」焦氏答曰：「月令，秦書，則獄名也，漢曰若盧，魏曰司空是也。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"尔雅刘熙释名：囹，领也；圄，御也；领录囚徒禁御也。礼记正义：崇精问曰：「狱，周曰圜土，殷曰羑里，夏曰均台；囹圄，何代之狱？」焦氏答曰：「月令，秦书，则狱名也，汉曰若卢，魏曰司空是也。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8f52385e-db0e-11ef-a693-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"申不害","people_name_jianti_auto":"申不害","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f52386e-db0e-11ef-8cb4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"商鞅","people_name_jianti_auto":"商鞅","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f52386f-db0e-11ef-a00f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"申不害、商鞅也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"申不害、商鞅也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"8f52386d-db0e-11ef-b573-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f523871-db0e-11ef-b531-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：狼性皆貪，故謂貪者爲貪狼也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：狼性皆贪，故谓贪者为贪狼也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"8f523870-db0e-11ef-8f45-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f523873-db0e-11ef-a08a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：誅，責也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：诛，责也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"8f523872-db0e-11ef-aa7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f523876-db0e-11ef-9db4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"曾子","people_name_jianti_auto":"曾子","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f523877-db0e-11ef-8da4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"曾子","people_name_jianti_auto":"曾子","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8f523878-db0e-11ef-943e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"曾參","people_name_jianti_auto":"曾参","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f523879-db0e-11ef-b463-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：曾子之書也。曾子，曾參。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：曾子之书也。曾子，曾参。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":291,"tongjian_id":"8f523875-db0e-11ef-9c34-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申","people_name_jianti_auto":"申","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"8f52387e-db0e-11ef-acc6-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[申不害]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8f52385b-db0e-11ef-889e-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"líng","source_anchor_text":"成康之隆囹圄空虛四","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":75,"text":"囹","tongjian_id":"82addebc-5467-559f-9e09-cd837038b6d9"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8f52385b-db0e-11ef-889e-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yǔ","source_anchor_text":"康之隆囹圄空虛四十","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":76,"text":"圄","tongjian_id":"f4576c9d-3ec2-5492-bdf0-d1e530d5b415"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"臣聞聖王之治天下也，少則習之學，長則材諸位，爵祿以養其德，刑罰以威其惡，故民曉於禮誼而恥犯其上。武王行大誼，平殘賊，周公作禮樂以文之；至於成、康之隆，囹圄空虛四十餘年：此亦敎化之漸而仁誼之流，非獨傷肌膚之效也。至秦則不然。師申、商之法，行韓非之說，憎帝王之道，以貪狼爲俗，誅名而不察實，爲善者不必免而犯惡者未必刑也。是以百官皆飾虛辭而不顧實，外有事君之禮，內有背上之心，造僞飾詐，趨利無恥；是以刑者甚衆，死者相望，而姦不息，俗化使然也。今陛下幷有天下，莫不率服，而功不加於百姓者，殆王心未加焉。曾子曰：『尊其所聞，則高明矣；行其所知，則光大矣。高明光大，不在於他，在乎加之意而已。』願陛下因用所聞，設誠於內而致行之，則三王何異哉！","content_fanyi":"我听说圣明的君王治理天下，是让他们在年少时学习，成年后根据才能授予职位，用爵禄来培养他们的德行，用刑罚来威慑他们的恶行，因此百姓通晓礼义，以冒犯君上为耻。周武王推行大义，平定残暴害民之人；周公制作礼乐来修饰政教；到了成王、康王的盛世，监狱空虚达四十多年：这也是教化逐渐浸润、仁义流传的结果，不只是伤害身体肌肤的刑罚所起的作用。到了秦朝就不是这样。它尊奉申不害、商鞅的法令，推行韩非的学说，憎恶帝王之道，把贪婪凶狠当作风气，只追究虚名而不考察实际，做好事的人未必能免于刑罚，犯罪作恶的人也不一定受到惩处。因此百官都粉饰虚辞而不顾实际，表面上有事奉君主的礼节，内心却怀有背叛君主的念头，弄虚作假，追逐财利而毫无羞耻；因此受刑的人很多，死尸接连相望，但奸邪仍然不止，这是风俗教化造成的。如今陛下统一拥有天下，没有人不归顺服从，但功德没有施加到百姓身上，大概是王道之心还没有用在这里。曾子说：‘尊崇自己所听到的道理，就会高明；践行自己所知道的道理，就会光大。高明光大，不在于别的，只在于对此用心罢了。’希望陛下凭依所听到的道理，在内心树立真诚并努力推行，那么与三王相比又有什么差别呢！","content_jianti_auto":"臣闻圣王之治天下也，少则习之学，长则材诸位，爵禄以养其德，刑罚以威其恶，故民晓于礼谊而耻犯其上。武王行大谊，平残贼，周公作礼乐以文之；至于成、康之隆，囹圄空虚四十余年：此亦教化之渐而仁谊之流，非独伤肌肤之效也。至秦则不然。师申、商之法，行韩非之说，憎帝王之道，以贪狼为俗，诛名而不察实，为善者不必免而犯恶者未必刑也。是以百官皆饰虚辞而不顾实，外有事君之礼，内有背上之心，造伪饰诈，趋利无耻；是以刑者甚众，死者相望，而奸不息，俗化使然也。今陛下幷有天下，莫不率服，而功不加于百姓者，殆王心未加焉。曾子曰：『尊其所闻，则高明矣；行其所知，则光大矣。高明光大，不在于他，在乎加之意而已。』愿陛下因用所闻，设诚于内而致行之，则三王何异哉！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1360,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第十七 (漢紀九) / 世宗孝武皇帝上之上 / 建元元年 / 第 4 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f52385b-db0e-11ef-889e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-140,"zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000522"},"tongjian_id":"8f52385b-db0e-11ef-889e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"明帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"明帝","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8f544812-db0e-11ef-b9cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"莊","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f544813-db0e-11ef-bb26-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢書作「嚴助」，蓋明帝諱莊，避之也。會，工外翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉书作「严助」，盖明帝讳庄，避之也。会，工外翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8f544811-db0e-11ef-ac4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"董仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"董仲舒","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8f544816-db0e-11ef-8281-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"公孫弘","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙弘","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8f544817-db0e-11ef-84ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲舒","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8f544818-db0e-11ef-93e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔氏","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8f544819-db0e-11ef-9d72-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲舒","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8f54481a-db0e-11ef-b105-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲舒","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8f54481b-db0e-11ef-a5e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲舒","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"8f54481c-db0e-11ef-9099-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"莊助","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄助","start_index":157,"tongjian_id":"8f54481d-db0e-11ef-9731-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲舒","start_index":190,"tongjian_id":"8f54481e-db0e-11ef-9d88-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"主父偃","people_name_jianti_auto":"主父偃","start_index":197,"tongjian_id":"8f54481f-db0e-11ef-9f7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲舒","start_index":206,"tongjian_id":"8f544820-db0e-11ef-bfd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲舒","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲舒","start_index":239,"tongjian_id":"8f544821-db0e-11ef-8e93-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"閩越","place_name_jianti_auto":"闽越","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"8f544822-db0e-11ef-95bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東甌","place_name_jianti_auto":"东瓯","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"8f544823-db0e-11ef-a2be-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遼東","place_name_jianti_auto":"辽东","start_index":179,"tongjian_id":"8f544824-db0e-11ef-bcc5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"高庙","start_index":181,"tongjian_id":"8f544825-db0e-11ef-8d43-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"长陵","start_index":184,"tongjian_id":"8f544826-db0e-11ef-b3e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高園","place_name_jianti_auto":"高园","start_index":186,"tongjian_id":"8f544827-db0e-11ef-bef3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"按考異曰：漢書·武紀：「元光元年五月，詔舉賢良，董仲舒、公孫弘出焉。」仲舒傳曰：「仲舒對冊，推明孔氏，抑黜百家。立學校之官，州縣舉茂才、孝廉，皆自仲舒發之。」今舉孝廉在元光元年十一月，若對策在下五月，則不得云自仲舒發之，蓋武紀誤也。然仲舒對策，不知果在何時；元光元年以前，唯今年舉賢良見於紀。三年，閩越、東甌相攻，莊助已爲中大夫，故皆著之於此。仲舒傳又云：「遼東高廟、長陵高園災。仲舒推說其意；主父偃竊其書奏之，仲舒由是得罪。」按二災在建元六年，主父偃傳，上書召見在元光元年。蓋仲舒追述二災而作書，或作書不上，而偃後來方見其草藁也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"按考异曰：汉书·武纪：「元光元年五月，诏举贤良，董仲舒、公孙弘出焉。」仲舒传曰：「仲舒对册，推明孔氏，抑黜百家。立学校之官，州县举茂才、孝廉，皆自仲舒发之。」今举孝廉在元光元年十一月，若对策在下五月，则不得云自仲舒发之，盖武纪误也。然仲舒对策，不知果在何时；元光元年以前，唯今年举贤良见于纪。三年，闽越、东瓯相攻，庄助已为中大夫，故皆著之于此。仲舒传又云：「辽东高庙、长陵高园灾。仲舒推说其意；主父偃窃其书奏之，仲舒由是得罪。」按二灾在建元六年，主父偃传，上书召见在元光元年。盖仲舒追述二灾而作书，或作书不上，而偃后来方见其草藁也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8f544815-db0e-11ef-9c26-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"江都易王","people_name_jianti_auto":"江都易王","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f544831-db0e-11ef-ae7d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"非","people_name_jianti_auto":"非","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f544832-db0e-11ef-96c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f544833-db0e-11ef-8c6f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"江都易王非，景帝子，帝之兄也。諡法：好更故舊曰易；音亦。","note_content_jianti_auto":"江都易王非，景帝子，帝之兄也。谥法：好更故旧曰易；音亦。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"8f544830-db0e-11ef-8d25-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"好，呼到翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"好，呼到翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"8f544835-db0e-11ef-8187-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"江都相","official_note":"江都相是江都国的国相，负责辅佐诸侯王治理封地，在汉代属于地方行政官职。此处董仲舒被任命为江都相，以辅佐易王，体现了其以儒家礼教匡正王侯的职责。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以仲舒爲江都相","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"e2b2faee-7455-4538-8392-d0e251f028d9"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中大夫","official_note":"中大夫是汉代中央官职，属于郎中令属官，负责顾问应对，参与朝政讨论。此处庄助因贤良对策被提拔为中大夫，反映了汉武帝时期重视人才选拔以加强中央集权。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"擢爲中大夫","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"0661dde5-6821-406e-bc10-7a109daafa3a"},{"confidence":0.98,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"丞相","official_note":"丞相是汉代最高行政长官，辅佐皇帝处理全国政务，位列三公之首。此处卫绾以丞相身份上奏，建议罢免某些贤良，显示了丞相在政策制定和官员选拔中的核心作用。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"丞相衞綰奏","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"f8dc1173-46c4-48cf-9af5-81a2bc261c48"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"博士","official_note":"博士是汉代学官，负责教授经学、参与议政，尤其在汉武帝时期地位重要，与独尊儒术政策相关。此处董仲舒在汉景帝时担任博士，奠定其学者身份，为后来任江都相提供背景。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"孝景時爲博士","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8d69c00e-bdef-4ba6-aa70-331db66f2001"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-385,"link_death_year":-337,"link_td_description":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","link_td_id":"Q10002622","link_td_number_id":204443,"people_name":"申","people_name_jianti_auto":"申","people_xingming":"申不害","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8f54483b-db0e-11ef-9565-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[申不害]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉举贤良","excerpts":[{"context_after":"是时，对者百余人，帝独善庄助对，擢为中大夫。后六年，当元...","context_before":"汉武帝建元元年，诏举贤良方正直言极谏之士。","source_end_index":61,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8f1d1190-5376-404c-a6a6-c596e39f28be","source_start_index":21,"source_text":"丞相绾奏：“所举贤良，或治申、商、韩非、苏秦、张仪之言，乱国政，请皆罢。”奏可。"},{"context_after":"后六年，当元光元年，复诏举贤良，于是董仲舒等出焉。《资治...","context_before":"...治申、商、韩非、苏秦、张仪之言，乱国政，请皆罢。”奏可。","source_end_index":83,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8f1d1190-5376-404c-a6a6-c596e39f28be","source_start_index":61,"source_text":"是时，对者百余人，帝独善庄助对，擢为中大夫。"}],"path":"续笔/卷六/汉举贤良","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"天子善其對，以仲舒爲江都相。會稽莊助亦以賢良對策，天子擢爲中大夫。丞相衞綰奏：「所舉賢良，或治申、韓、蘇、張之言亂國政者，請皆罷。」奏可。董仲舒少治春秋，孝景時爲博士，進退容止，非禮不行，學者皆師尊之。及爲江都相，事易王。易王，帝兄，素驕，好勇。仲舒以禮匡正，王敬重焉。","content_fanyi":"天子很赞赏他的对答，任命董仲舒为江都国相。会稽人庄助也以贤良身份应策，天子将他提拔为中大夫。丞相卫绾上奏说：“所察举的贤良中，凡是研习申不害、韩非、苏秦、张仪之学而扰乱国政的，请一律罢免。”武帝批准了这一奏请。董仲舒从小研治《春秋》，孝景帝时任博士，进退举止都依礼而行，不合礼的事不做，学者们都把他当老师一样尊崇。等到他担任江都国相，侍奉江都易王。易王刘非是武帝的兄长，向来骄纵，喜好勇力。董仲舒用礼义加以匡正，易王对他很敬重。","content_jianti_auto":"天子善其对，以仲舒为江都相。会稽庄助亦以贤良对策，天子擢为中大夫。丞相衞绾奏：「所举贤良，或治申、韩、苏、张之言乱国政者，请皆罢。」奏可。董仲舒少治春秋，孝景时为博士，进退容止，非礼不行，学者皆师尊之。及为江都相，事易王。易王，帝兄，素骄，好勇。仲舒以礼匡正，王敬重焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1368,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第十七 (漢紀九) / 世宗孝武皇帝上之上 / 建元元年 / 第 12 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8f544810-db0e-11ef-94b3-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-140,"zhang_TJZJ_id":"zttjzj_000528"},"tongjian_id":"8f544810-db0e-11ef-94b3-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":2,"total_paragraphs":8},"profile":{"alias_list":["申子"],"biography":"申不害，尊称申子，中国战国时代郑国京邑（今河南荥阳）人，郑国被韩国所灭之后，以法家学说，成为韩昭侯的宰相，为中国先秦诸子百家中法家“术”派代表人物。著作《申子》。","birth_year":-385,"death_year":-337,"link_td_id":"Q10002622","name":"申不害","number_id":204443},"relationships":[{"direction":"forward","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"君臣关系（申不害为韩昭侯的宰相），来源文本：以法家學說，成為韓昭侯的宰相","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10002622","source_person_name":"申不害","source_person_number_id":204443,"statement_id":"S-Q10002622-P100061-Q10000677","target_person_id":"Q10000677","target_person_name":"韩昭侯","target_person_number_id":210906},{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"思想推崇，来源文本：为政严猛，崇尚法家申不害、韩非，立断善恶。","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10007549","source_person_name":"樊晔","source_person_number_id":6202555,"statement_id":"S-Q10007549-P100061-Q10002622","target_person_id":"Q10002622","target_person_name":"申不害","target_person_number_id":204443}]},"message":"success","success":true}